{"fields":[{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasIntroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"intro","n":"IntroAudio"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasPromptAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"prompt","n":"PromptAudio","s":"Quels sont les ANCIENNES Régions françaises frontalières avec d'autres pays ?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio0"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_0_hint","n":"ClueAudio0","s":"You all need to get your BERINGS ... straight."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio1"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_1_hint","n":"ClueAudio1","s":"Think \"west,\" like as west as you can go."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio2"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_2_hint","n":"ClueAudio2","s":"Potatoes, anyone? Taters?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio3"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_3_hint","n":"ClueAudio3","s":"Don't forget Big Sky Country."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio4"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_4_hint","n":"ClueAudio4","s":"What's the state with Mount Rushmore? Is it that one? Not sure."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio5"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_5_hint","n":"ClueAudio5","s":"If there's one you cannot miss, it's this one. Just imagine Canada, but with a gigantic mall."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio6"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_6_hint","n":"ClueAudio6"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio7"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_7_hint","n":"ClueAudio7","s":"The password for this state is... Lake Erie. Good luck."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio8"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_8_hint","n":"ClueAudio8","s":"Did you know Ben Franklin visited Canada? He had that stupid hat to keep him warm I guess."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio9"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_9_hint","n":"ClueAudio9","s":"It's only the 4th most populated state in the US. Easy to forget."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio10"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_10_hint","n":"ClueAudio10","s":"I wonder if Bernie Sanders ever went to Canada."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio11"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_11_hint","n":"ClueAudio11"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio12"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_12_hint","n":"ClueAudio12","s":"I'm sure Stephen King's spent time in Canada. Polite and scary is a terrifying combo."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasFollowupAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"followup","n":"FollowupAudio","s":"I'll give you a hint: *some* have water borders. I'm very generous."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasOutroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"outro","n":"OutroAudio"}]}
